About this file
---------------

This file lists every third-party component that the planned installers and
archives ship (section 2), the files in this repository that are not under
the project licence (section 3), the Star Citizen Fan Kit unit (section 4),
material adapted from other projects (section 5) and the credits that the
bundled licences require (section 6).

The project is in its planning phase and ships nothing yet; section 2
describes what the plan ships. Values in angle brackets are filled in when a
component is pinned. Square brackets mark points that are unverified or not
yet decided; the open ones are tracked in docs/adr/0000-open-points.md. Once
the build exists, every entry is checked against the shipped artefacts, not
against upstream repositories, because the two can differ.

Not shipped, and therefore not listed: the build, test and CI tools (Cargo,
the Rust toolchain, cargo-packager 0.11.8, the WiX tools of 3.11.2 except the
parts that the MSI embeds, section 2.11, cargo-deny, cargo-vet, xtask and its
dependencies), which are run but never conveyed; Ollama and the model weights
it downloads, which the user installs; UEX data, which the app fetches at run
time.

Amended 2026-10-12 (ADR-0005): the implementation language changed from Java
27 with JavaFX and Gradle to Rust with egui and Cargo. Entries for components
that only the Java stack shipped are marked superseded and keep their number,
so that references to them stay valid; sections 2.15 to 2.19 cover the Rust
stack. Where an entry still names a version of a Java artefact, it describes
what the earlier plan evaluated, and the artefact that is actually shipped is
pinned in M0.


