The app shows the Star Citizen Fan Kit unit, adopted as in basetool: the
"Made By The Community" logo together with the two notices below, always as
one unit. It appears in the app's About dialog and on its onboarding start
screen (R-UI-19) and in README.md; further places only with the project
owner's approval. [Whether these placements satisfy the placement rule of
Fan Kit Guidelines section 2b and the "reasonably prominent location" of
Agreement clause 2(g) for a desktop app is open point O-79.] The logo files
are artwork of Cloud Imperium Rights LLC and Cloud Imperium Rights Ltd.,
used under the Fankit Agreement and the Fan Kit Guidelines. They are not
covered by the project licence, and this project grants no rights in them
(LICENSES/LicenseRef-Fankit-Agreement.txt).

